Fall wird auf die pathId der baubetroffenen Trasse (FPE) referenziert).',259,'{"canonical_url":null,"normalized_sha256":"964d24cd41f50e75b8bb1d06f76d9cc47af41a110c36b4bb8a20597a3a823500","page":31,"source_id":"src_49e6bd4a29f18c068815","source_sha256":"ad7a22df2cd5529c685aa7d10d878783f41dcf2902c4bb7c1a233c97810359ca","source_version_id":"sv_ad7a22df2cd5529c685aa7d1"}','1d0ca2e418c60e275f4fe738a05441af12416c21bae9ab8dbca0a5157a1a4a59');

